    {
      "title": "Mamdani says ICE agents who shot man in New York looked like ‘mass shooters’",
      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/oct/12/mamdani-ice-new-york-shooting",
      "description": "<p>Mayor calls for end to agency’s operations in city after agents shot and wounded man with five-year-old in car</p><p>The New York mayor, <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/zohran-mamdani\">Zohran Mamdani</a>, on Sunday compared US Immigration and Customs Enforcement (<a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/ice-us-immigration-and-customs-enforcement\">ICE</a>)’s recent shooting of a man in the Manhattan enclave of Marble Hill to a mass shooting scene – and called for an end to the agency’s operations in his city.</p><p>Mamdani’s joined MS NOW’s Jacob Soboroff for his first media interview since ICE agents shot and wounded Oscar Belgal, 28, during an enforcement operation while he was in his car with his five-year-old child also inside.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/oct/12/mamdani-ice-new-york-shooting\">Continue reading...</a>",
      "source_name": "The Guardian World",
      "published": "2026-10-12T15:03:07"
    },
    {
      "title": "Zohran Mamdani orders use-of-force review for New York City police",
